@startuml
title Technical Debt Cycle

skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ActivityFontSize 13
skinparam ArrowColor #555555
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

|#FFE8E8| Debt Spiral |
start

:Fast & Dirty Code\n(Ship faster now); <<#FF6B6B>>

:Technical Debt\nAccumulates; <<#FF8787>>

:Development\nSlows Down; <<#FFA07A>>

:More Shortcuts\n(Under pressure); <<#FF6347>>

if (Refactor now?) then (YES - Escape Path)

  |#E8FFE8| Refactoring Path |

  :Identify Code Smells; <<#69DB7C>>

  :Apply Small\nRefactoring Steps; <<#51CF66>>

  :Run Tests\n(All must pass); <<#40C057>>

  :Clean, Maintainable Code; <<#37B24D>>

  stop

else (NO - Continue shortcuts)

  |#FFE8E8| Debt Spiral |

  :More Bugs,\nMore Complexity; <<#FF4500>>

  :**Project Becomes\nUnmaintainable!**; <<#DC143C>>

  stop

endif

@enduml
